        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "policy: preview review-required gateway repairs",
        "body": "## Summary\n- Restacked on current `main` after #99731 merged.\n- Adds review-required `doctor --fix` previews for Gateway policy findings that should not be auto-mutated:\n  - `policy/gateway-non-loopback-bind`: previews setting `gateway.bind=loopback` for `gateway.bind` and `gateway.customBindHost` non-loopback findings.\n  - `policy/gateway-node-command-denied`: previews appending the missing command to `gateway.nodes.denyCommands`.\n- Preserves skipped repair preview `changes` in the structured repair flow so review-required guidance is visible without counting the check as repaired.\n- Documents the Gateway review-required preview behavior in `docs/cli/policy.md`; no generic Doctor docs were changed.\n\n## Real behavior proof\nBehavior or issue addressed:\n`doctor --fix` surfaces review-required preview guidance for Gateway bind and Gateway node-command policy findings without mutating config or counting the check as repaired.\n\nReal environment tested:\nWindows PowerShell. Source checkout at PR head `a858ef0`, rebased on upstream `main` after #99731 merged.\n\nExact steps or command run after this patch:\n1. `git diff --check`\n2. `rg -n \"<<<<<<<|=======|>>>>>>>\" docs/cli/policy.md`\n3. `node scripts/check-docs-mdx.mjs docs/cli/policy.md docs/cli/doctor.md`\n4. `pnpm docs:map:check`\n5. `git diff --stat`\n\nEvidence after fix:\nWhitespace check exited 0. Conflict marker search returned no matches. Docs MDX check passed for `docs/cli/policy.md` and `docs/cli/doctor.md`. `pnpm docs:map:check` passed and reported `docs/docs_map.md is up to date`. The final docs repair is one Policy doc file, 7 insertions, documenting skipped non-mutating preview guidance for `policy/gateway-non-loopback-bind` and `policy/gateway-node-command-denied`.\n\nObserved result after fix:\nThe PR now documents that Gateway bind and node-command findings stay review-required: `doctor --fix` reports proposed `gateway.bind` or `gateway.nodes.denyCommands` changes as skipped preview guidance, does not apply the change, and does not count the finding as repaired until an operator reviews and updates config or policy.\n\nWhat was not tested:\nNo packaged CLI invocation was run in this docs-only update.\n\n## Stack\n- Base: `main`\n- Follow-up: #101336 adds agent/tool review-required previews on top of this slice.",
